@tyler9061/dsh-auth README · i18n & theme：- UI strings follow the main client language (zh/en via `ctx.locale`);
  the login page follows the browser language.
- The settings UI uses the main client design tokens (`--dsw-alias-*`) and
  adapts to light/dark themes automatically.

@tyler9061/dsh-auth README · Development：```
npm test        # node:test unit tests
```

